          4 OK         5 T-068                                                      EXIT CRITERION: a db_owner connection with NO session context sees zero rows                                                                                                                             SELECT COUNT (*) FROM dbo.CaseFile returned 0 and dbo.CaseNote returned 0, with 4 and 2 rows actually present. IS_ROLEMEMBER (db_owner) = 1, IS_ROLEMEMBER (rlsBypassRole) = 0. THIS IS THE ONE EVERY NEW DEVELOPER MEETS COLD: the table is not empty, the query is not wrong, and being db_owner does not help -- there is no session context, so the filter predicate matches nothing. UI-18. The cure is to set the context (section 6) or, for genuine maintenance, to join rlsBypassRole and call auth.uspBeginMaintenanceSession (section 7), which leaves a logs.AuthenticationEvent row behind on purpose.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
          4 OK         5 T-068                                                      Setting BypassRowSecurity brings the same rows straight back, and clearing it hides them again                                                                                                           With the key set the count is 4 of 4; cleared again it is 0. Nothing else changed between the two counts -- same connection, same statement, same rows. One writable session-context key is the whole difference, which is why 170_permissions.sql grants EXECUTE on the maintenance procedures to rlsBypassRole alone and why DES 10.5 wants that role empty between jobs. It is also why a report tool that connects as db_owner and forgets the context will show an empty dataset rather than an error.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
